<title>USA: Lifeline Systems Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Lifeline Systems Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the three months ended March 31, 1997 and March 31, 1996</p>
<p>		(In thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>		     Three months ended    Three months ended</p>
<p>			  March 31, 1997	  March 31, 1996</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p>  Net product sales			$5,918	$5,467</p>
<p>  Services				    7,349	 5,419</p>
<p>  Finance and rental income		 289	   270</p>
<p>    Total revenues			 13,556	11,156</p>
<p>Costs and expenses</p>
<p>  Cost of sales			     1,810	 1,936</p>
<p>  Cost of services			  3,362	 2,448</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>    administrative			  6,337	 5,280</p>
<p>  Research and Development		  429	   483</p>
<p>Total costs and expenses		 12,138	10,147</p>
<p>Income from operations		    1,418	 1,009</p>
<p>Other income, net			     160	   166</p>
<p>Income before taxes			 1,578	 1,175</p>
<p>Provision for income taxes		  623	   485</p>
<p>Net income				     $955	  $690</p>
<p>Net income per common share	     $0.15	 $0.11</p>
<p>Average shares outstanding		6,246	 6,166</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Lifeline Systems Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
